id: PHP-SEC-016
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: block
title: XXE in PHP XML parsers
category: security
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .php
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/
  content_contains: xml
patterns:
  - regex: simplexml_load_string\(.*\$_(GET|POST|REQUEST)
    message: "simplexml_load_string with user input — XXE risk. Call libxml_disable_entity_loader(true) first (PHP < 8.0)"
  - regex: DOMDocument.*loadXML.*\$_(GET|POST|REQUEST)
    message: "DOMDocument loadXML with user input — XXE vulnerability"
fix: Use libxml_disable_entity_loader(true) before parsing (PHP < 8.0). In PHP 8.0+, external entities are disabled by default.
